// What the player picked on a menu this frame. The menus (main-menu.chaos, pause-menu.chaos)
// only record the choice in the UI model; main.nyx acts on it, so the game's state machine stays
// in one place.
MenuChoice :: enum {
    Nothing,
    Play,
    Resume,
    Restart,
    ToggleDebugHud,
    MainMenu,
    Quit
}
